Position [SimTalk] - Interface
Sets the Position in % of the Interface designated by <Path> at which an incoming or outgoing Connector
is shown at the icon of the Frame.
Remarks
Plant Simulation uses the value you specify, when you activate File > Preferences > General > Connect
Objects Automatically.
Connecting objects automatically only works, when the exit of FrameA and the entrance of FrameB are not
more than three pixels apart.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Position:integer
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type integer.
Specify a value between 0 and 100 percent.
Position 0 is either the top or the left-hand side at the icon of the Frame.
Position 100 is the bottom or the right-hand side at the icon.
Example
interface.Position := 53
See also
Position in % [Interface]
Connect Objects Automatically [model settings]
